":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-10T16:52:25Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T10:03:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5 Stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.0.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M2 - Apple M2 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting the new `use_fov_override` variable to true on a StandardMaterial3D in combination with setting `stencil_mode` to `STENCIL_MODE_OUTLINE` causes the outline to visually \"detach\" from the mesh when changing the camera's FOV (during an action like sprinting, for instance).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new 3D scene, add a Camera3D and MeshInstance3D. Position the MeshInstance in front of the Camera3D, set it's Mesh to anything (a BoxMesh, for instance), add a new StandardMaterial3D, and set the `use_fov_override` variable to true on a StandardMaterial3D and the `stencil_mode` to `STENCIL_MODE_OUTLINE`. Select the Camera3D again and, with the MeshInstance3D in frame, play around with the FOV and observe the outline detaching/separating from the mesh.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111482/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}